<diagram program="umletino" version="15.1"><zoom_level>10</zoom_level><help_text>-What's the endpoint of the software? It's constantly running so it's not really something that "ends" unless we treat like a daily or weekly thing. The project doc says interactive mode is "During the day," but then what's our software's "day"? Does the day end when Acme updates the records? The software couldn't stop at 9 P.M. because it still has to run MAP at 12 A.M. on Fridays. 

